# Practical 8: Register-reference Instructions — INC, SPA, SNA, SZE

## Aim
To simulate the register-reference instructions INC, SPA, SNA and SZE using CPU Sim and determine the values of AC, E, PC, AR and IR in decimal after execution.

## Software Required
CPU Sim 4.0.11 and the BasicComputer.cpu machine.

## Program File
`P08_REGISTER_REF_INC_SPA_SNA_SZE.a`

## Result
The INC, SPA, SNA and SZE instructions are simulated, and the register values are observed after execution.
